  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "5. Fable 5 & Mythos 5 Fully Restored After Export Control Lifted",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "CREDIBILITY: ★★★★★  ◆  CATEGORY: Model Release/Policy  ◆  DATE: June 30 (lifted) / July 1 (restored)"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "The US Commerce Department lifted the 18-day export controls on Fable 5 and Mythos 5. Both models returned globally on July 1 at 3:31 PM ET. Notably, Anthropic's own testing showed Opus 4.8, GPT-5.5, and Kimi K2.7 could all reproduce the exploit that triggered the original ban, undercutting the argument that Fable 5 posed a unique risk. Anthropic is now co-developing a jailbreak severity framework with Amazon, Microsoft, and Google."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "FACT CHECK: ✅ Confirmed by Anthropic's own statement and multiple independent outlets. Restoration time/date verified. Note: Fable 5 billing shifts from subscription-included to usage credits on July 7."
