  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "SOURCES: Anthropic Blog (anthropic.com/news)  •  BuildFastWithAI  •  AIToolsRecap"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "6. Claude Sonnet 5 Launched — Most Agentic Mid-Size Model Yet",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "CREDIBILITY: ★★★★★  ◆  CATEGORY: Model Release  ◆  DATE: June 30, 2026"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Anthropic launched Claude Sonnet 5 as the default model for Free and Pro plans. Intro pricing: $2/M input, $10/M output tokens (through Aug 31), then $3/$15 standard. Described as the most agentic Sonnet yet — capable of planning, using browsers/terminals, and running autonomously at performance near Opus 4.8 but at a fraction of the cost. TechCrunch framed it as signaling that agentic capability is now table stakes."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "FACT CHECK: ✅ Directly from Anthropic's announcement and TechCrunch. Pricing and dates verified."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "SOURCES: Anthropic Blog (anthropic.com)  •  TechCrunch (techcrunch.com)"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "7. GPT-5.6 Sol/Terra/Luna — General Access Imminent",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "CREDIBILITY: ★★★★☆  ◆  CATEGORY: Model Release  ◆  DATE: June 26 preview; access expected July 7–10"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "OpenAI's next-gen GPT-5.6 family (Sol: flagship reasoning, Terra: balanced general-purpose, Luna: low-cost production) remains in limited government-approved preview (~20 organizations). Sol scored 91.9% on Terminal-Bench 2.1 (vs. Fable 5's 84.3% and Mythos 5's 88.0%). Pricing: Sol $5/$30 per M tokens, Terra $2.50/$15, Luna $1/$6. General access expected the week of July 7, contingent on the White House framework announcement."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "FACT CHECK: ✅ Sol's Terminal-Bench score confirmed across multiple sources. Pricing confirmed. General access date is an analyst projection, not an official commitment — treat as \"likely\" not \"certain.\""
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "SOURCES: OpenAI (openai.com)  •  BuildFastWithAI  •  unrot.co"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
