  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "8. Gemini 3.5 Pro Begins Rollout — 2M Token Context Window",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "CREDIBILITY: ★★★★☆  ◆  CATEGORY: Model Release  ◆  DATE: Early July 2026 (after missing May & June)"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Google's Gemini 3.5 Pro is finally trickling out with a 2-million-token context window — the largest of any production frontier model, doubling Fable 5, Opus 4.8, and GPT-5.6 Sol's practical limit (~400K). Pricing: $1.25/$10 per M tokens standard, Deep Think reasoning mode gated to $250/month Ultra tier. The 2M window is a genuine differentiator for codebase-level reasoning and multi-hour agent runs."
