    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Microsoft created a new operating business with a $2.5B investment, embedding approximately 6,000 industry and engineering experts directly into client organizations for co-design and deployment of AI systems. Early partners include Unilever and Novo Nordisk. Focus is on measurable ROI and IP protection — a shift from selling AI models to delivering full transformation."
