    "level": 2
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "11. Chinese AI Models Surge to ~45% of OpenRouter Traffic",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "CREDIBILITY: ★★★★☆  ◆  CATEGORY: Market  ◆  DATE: Q2 2026 data, reported July 6"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Chinese AI providers now serve ~45% of all OpenRouter traffic, up from less than 2% a year ago. Xiaomi's MiMo-V2-Pro leads with 21.1% market share (4.21 trillion weekly tokens), compared to OpenAI's 7.5%. The shift is driven by dramatically lower pricing — Grok 4.3 at $2.50/M output vs. Claude Sonnet 5 at $10 and GPT-5.5 at $15."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "FACT CHECK: ✅ Data compiled from Q2 2026 Chinese AI market analysis. Token volume and market share figures verified against OpenRouter public data where available. Xiaomi's specific share should be treated as an estimate based on available telemetry."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "SOURCES: BuildFastWithAI  •  OpenRouter analytics  •  CNBC (cnbc.com)"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "text": "12. Anthropic Overtakes OpenAI on Revenue",
    "level": 3
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "CREDIBILITY: ★★★★☆  ◆  CATEGORY: Business  ◆  DATE: Reported July 3 (crossover occurred April 2026)"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "Anthropic has overtaken OpenAI in self-reported revenue for the first time — $47B annualized run rate vs. OpenAI's ~$25B. The crossover actually occurred in April 2026 but was re-reported this week amid the IPO filing context. Anthropic is targeting up to $965B IPO valuation; OpenAI up to $1 trillion."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "FACT CHECK: ⚠️ The revenue crossover is April 2026 news being recycled this week in the context of IPO filings. Figures are self-reported (not independently audited). Treat as directional, not precise."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "SOURCES: Fortune (fortune.com)  •  CNBC  •  AI Weekly"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "──────────────────────────────────────────────"
  },
