    "type": "paragraph",
    "text": "METHODOLOGY: Each story cross-verified against 3+ independent outlets. Credibility ratings based on source quality, cross-source consistency, and primary vs. secondary sourcing. ★★★★★ = primary source + multiple independent confirmations. ★★★★☆ = multiple reliable secondary sources. Fact checks flag disputed claims, recycled news, and analyst projections vs. confirmed facts."
